<p class="lh">Enterprise content operations are often the hidden determinant of digital performance. Even with a capable CMS like Sitefinity, organizations struggle when governance, workflow discipline, and technical release practices are not aligned. This infographic provides a practical blueprint for operating Sitefinity at scale across multi-site, multilingual, and campaign-intensive environments where editorial velocity and platform stability must coexist.</p>

<p class="lh">The visual is built for marketing operations leaders, .NET CMS owners, digital platform managers, and enterprise delivery teams who need a shared operating model. It translates common pain points into structured controls: unclear role ownership, inconsistent content modeling, release friction, personalization complexity, and weak measurement integration. The goal is to help teams move from reactive publishing to durable content operations maturity.</p>

